        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Assumed average current technology. The raw materials are mixed in an assumed average ratio, transported to the packing installation and packed.\n\n# Included processes\nIncludes the whole manufacturing process to produce anhydrite floor (raw material provision, raw material mixing, packing, and storage), transports to plant, and infrastructure. No requirements for administration are included. No additional buildings and land-use are taken into account as it is assumed that the mixing process takes place in an existing building of the sand/cement industry or on the construction site</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
